# Full Stack Dealership Application

## Project Details

**Repository Name:** xrwvm-fullstack_developer_capstone

**Project Name:** Full Stack Dealership Application

## Project Description

This project is a full-stack dealership application developed using Django and React. It allows users to explore car dealerships, view dealership details, register and log in, and submit reviews.

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Django
- React
- JavaScript
- HTML
- CSS
- REST API
- Docker
- Kubernetes
- GitHub Actions

## Main Features
- User registration and login
- View all dealerships
- Filter dealerships by state
- View dealership details
- Read and submit dealership reviews
- Car makes and models retrieval
- Sentiment analysis of customer reviews

